# Selene OS base system (owned by the ISO build).
# One package per line; blank lines and # comments are ignored. Packages are installed
# WITHOUT Recommends: list everything you need explicitly.
# The kernel is added by iso/build.sh ($KERNEL_PACKAGE, plus linux-firmware when WITH_FIRMWARE=1).

